assign, transfer, alienate, encumber or hypothecate any of its rights or obligations hereunder without the express prior written consent of the other party, except that Consolidated Artists shall have the right to assign the financial benefits hereof and TPC hereby consents to such assignment.","confidence":0.99,"reasoning":"This clause expressly restricts assignment and transfer of rights or obligations without prior written consent, which is classic anti-assignment language. It also includes a limited exception for assigning financial benefits."}
